<title>JAPAN: Eisai to make announcement on approval of product.</title>
<headline>Eisai to make announcement on approval of product.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-09-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Eisai Co Ltd said it would make an announcement at 4 p.m. (0700 GMT) on Wednesday about authorities' approval of a product it is developing.</p>
<p>A spokeswoman for Eisai, a pharmaceutical maker, said the company plans an announcement simultaneously in the United States but declined to elaborate on the contents of the announcement.</p>
